      "side": 1,
      "message": "these strings are all similar except for the operation (see 34 and 51). Suggest move this string construction into _send_notification to share it.\n\nI made this comment in patch set 11. I don\u0027t understand the response. I\u0027m suggesting move the string construction into _send_notification which is a function private to this module so other parts of Keystone are not going to be calling it.",
